    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find shells on the beach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on vacation at the beach and decide to look for shells, however, the beach is full of objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with random objects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close umbrellas and beach chairs, open cabin doors, do whatever is necessary to clear the view of objects that might cover shells, and more generally interact with everything on the beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the beach in search of shells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated beaches, which gives you the chance to find yourself at a different beach each time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find shells on the beach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/6e764ddb984076c5d37a1beeaef2c532.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on vacation at the beach and decide to look for shells, however, the beach is full of objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with random objects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/9a2bdc7b855726d81715c68e6ef4b692.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Close umbrellas and beach chairs, open cabin doors, do whatever is necessary to clear the view of objects that might cover shells, and more generally interact with everything on the beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the beach in search of shells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.poster.avif?t=1753873384\" width=640 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.webm?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376340/extras/b1a536d00125a081cc8b26e356f06952.mp4?t=1753873384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated beaches, which gives you the chance to find yourself at a different beach each time.</p>",
